text = "Welcome to 81 Sudokus!

For those unfamiliar with how Sudoku works, the rules are simple:
- Each row, column, and region (marked with thick lines) must contain each input exactly once. 
- Some inputs, called Givens, are filled in for you and cannot be changed.
- Valid inputs are displayed on the right.

Any errors will be highlighted in red. Your goal is to fill the grid completely.

Oh, and don't worry about the Extra Rules yet. We'll get to that soon :)"

